          "markdown": "##### Create powerful, data-driven documents for custom analytics and collaboration.\n\nExplore use case examples on the Dynatrace Playground\n\n* [Log Analysis](https://dt-url.net/playground-nb-logs)\n* [Trace Analysis](https://dt-url.net/playground-nb-traces)\n* [Davis Anomaly Detection](https://dt-url.net/playground-nb-davis)\n* [Security snippets](https://dt-url.net/playground-nb-security)\n* [DQL field extraction examples](https://dt-url.net/playground-nb-parse)\n* [Davis problem analysis](https://dt-url.net/playground-nb-davis-2)",
